{"id":"f75185e7cc39bda8","group":"58","path":"58/batch04/58-df-sierpinski.md","title":"Sierpinski","display":"df-sierpinski — Sierpinski","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-sierpinski","aliases":["58-df-sierpinski","Sierpinski"],"display":"df-sierpinski — Sierpinski","depends_on":["[[../batch05/58-df-compact.md]]","[[../batch16/58-df-function.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-sierpinski"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-sierpinski</span><span>Sierpinski</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-sierpinski — Sierpinski"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"050f6d05b2c94aea\" href=\"?note=050f6d05b2c94aea\" title=\"../batch05/58-df-compact.md\">../batch05/58-df-compact.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-function.md\">../batch16/58-df-function.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"v_1,v_2,v_3\\in\\mathbb R^2\">\\(v_1,v_2,v_3\\in\\mathbb R^2\\)</span> are the non-collinear vertices of an equilateral triangle</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\tau_{\\mathbb R^2}\">\\(\\tau_{\\mathbb R^2}\\)</span> is the Euclidean topology on <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbb R^2\">\\(\\mathbb R^2\\)</span>.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{SierpinskiGasket}_S\\subseteq V^4\">\\(\\operatorname{SierpinskiGasket}_S\\subseteq V^4\\)</span> (gasket predicate defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}sierpinski} \\vdash \\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\operatorname{SierpinskiGasket}_S(S,v_1,v_2,v_3)\\leftrightarrow{}\\\\\n&amp;\\quad v_1,v_2,v_3\\in\\mathbb R^2\\land0&lt;\\|v_1-v_2\\|=\\|v_2-v_3\\|=\\|v_3-v_1\\|\\\\\n&amp;\\quad{}\\land S\\subseteq\\mathbb R^2\\land S\\neq\\varnothing\\land\\mathrm{Compact}_S(S,\\tau_{\\mathbb R^2}\\upharpoonright S)\\\\\n&amp;\\quad{}\\land\\exists f_1,f_2,f_3\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\\bigwedge_{i=1}^{3}\\mathrm{Function}(f_i,\\mathbb R^2,\\mathbb R^2)\\land\\forall i\\in\\{1,2,3\\}\\;\\forall x\\in\\mathbb R^2\\;(f_i(x)=(x+v_i)/2)\\land S=\\bigcup_{i=1}^3f_i``S\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}sierpinski} \\vdash \\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\operatorname{SierpinskiGasket}_S(S,v_1,v_2,v_3)\\leftrightarrow{}\\\\\n&amp;\\quad v_1,v_2,v_3\\in\\mathbb R^2\\land0&lt;\\|v_1-v_2\\|=\\|v_2-v_3\\|=\\|v_3-v_1\\|\\\\\n&amp;\\quad{}\\land S\\subseteq\\mathbb R^2\\land S\\neq\\varnothing\\land\\mathrm{Compact}_S(S,\\tau_{\\mathbb R^2}\\upharpoonright S)\\\\\n&amp;\\quad{}\\land\\exists f_1,f_2,f_3\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\\bigwedge_{i=1}^{3}\\mathrm{Function}(f_i,\\mathbb R^2,\\mathbb R^2)\\land\\forall i\\in\\{1,2,3\\}\\;\\forall x\\in\\mathbb R^2\\;(f_i(x)=(x+v_i)/2)\\land S=\\bigcup_{i=1}^3f_i``S\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Sierpinski: one of the earliest fractals; the three contraction maps are existentially bound, and compactness reuses the canonical two-argument predicate.</li>\n<li>Triangle: <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S\">\\(S\\)</span> has empty interior and Hausdorff dimension <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\log 3/\\log 2\">\\(\\log 3/\\log 2\\)</span></li>\n<li>Carpet: 2D version; <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S^1\">\\(S^1\\)</span> is circle; many generalizations via iterated removal</li>\n<li>Menger: 3D generalization; <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S^3\">\\(S^3\\)</span> sponge with <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\log 20/\\log 3\">\\(\\log 20/\\log 3\\)</span> dimension</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Reference\">[Reference]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Falconer, Fractal Geometry</li>\n<li>Mandelbrot, The Fractal Geometry of Nature</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2},{"id":"Reference","text":"[Reference]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch05/58-df-compact.md","status":"resolved","id":"050f6d05b2c94aea","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch05/58-df-compact.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch16/58-df-function.md","status":"resolved","id":"36d7463d215be751","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch16/58-df-function.md]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"v_1,v_2,v_3\\in\\mathbb R^2","display":false},{"tex":"\\tau_{\\mathbb R^2}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathbb R^2","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{SierpinskiGasket}_S\\subseteq V^4","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}sierpinski} \\vdash \\begin{aligned}\n&\\operatorname{SierpinskiGasket}_S(S,v_1,v_2,v_3)\\leftrightarrow{}\\\\\n&\\quad v_1,v_2,v_3\\in\\mathbb R^2\\land0<\\|v_1-v_2\\|=\\|v_2-v_3\\|=\\|v_3-v_1\\|\\\\\n&\\quad{}\\land S\\subseteq\\mathbb R^2\\land S\\neq\\varnothing\\land\\mathrm{Compact}_S(S,\\tau_{\\mathbb R^2}\\upharpoonright S)\\\\\n&\\quad{}\\land\\exists f_1,f_2,f_3\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\\bigwedge_{i=1}^{3}\\mathrm{Function}(f_i,\\mathbb R^2,\\mathbb R^2)\\land\\forall i\\in\\{1,2,3\\}\\;\\forall x\\in\\mathbb R^2\\;(f_i(x)=(x+v_i)/2)\\land S=\\bigcup_{i=1}^3f_i``S\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"S","display":false},{"tex":"\\log 3/\\log 2","display":false},{"tex":"S^1","display":false},{"tex":"S^3","display":false},{"tex":"\\log 20/\\log 3","display":false}],"bytes":1613,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-1158","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch04/58-df-sierpinski.md|58-df-sierpinski]]（batch04）"}],"outgoing":["050f6d05b2c94aea","36d7463d215be751"]}